[engl]
{100}{}{Diana}
{200}{}{You see Diana, a desert raider.}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{Begin}
{1020}{}{over}
{2000}{}{I am Diana. How might I help you today?}
{2010}{}{I'm looking for a woman named Tandi. Have you seen her?}
{2020}{}{What do you do here?}
{2030}{}{Never mind, thanks.}
{3000}{}{If she is one of those women from Shady Sands, maybe you should look there. I just work here.}
{3010}{}{Oh. Well, thank you anyway.}
{4000}{}{I am the armorer for this encampment. I am the only one with the necessary skills to repair and maintain the weapons and
 equipment of Garl's men.}
{4010}{}{Can you fix my equipment for me?}
{4020}{}{What can you tell me about this camp?}
{5000}{}{It is run by Garl Death-Hand. He is a fearsome and remorseless leader. He makes sure that we all survive the harsh reality of the desert.}
{5010}{}{Can you fix my equipment for me?}
{6000}{}{I am busy now. Please go elsewhere.}
{6010}{}{Sure, maybe later.}

